; Caulder, sketch A "Clarinet in the Lab": C# minor, 112 bpm. A low clarinet creeps over fuzz bass eighths and 3+3+2 brass stabs, strings hold thirds; a chromatic hook and a climbing answer. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_a
tempo 112
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst clar = A.71 shift=-12
inst fz = A.97 shift=24
inst brass = A.111 shift=-12
inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst kit = A.120
inst timp = A.47 shift=24
